      "title": "http: add expert warning for whitespace in request-target",
      "message": "http: add expert warning for whitespace in request-target\n\nRFC 9112 §3.2 states \"No whitespace is allowed in the\nrequest-target.\"\n\nDetect embedded SP or HTAB characters in the extracted\nrequest-target and emit ei_http_request_uri_invalid when\nprohibited whitespace is present.\n\nValid request-targets are unaffected.\n\nAdd a regression capture and corresponding HTTP dissection\ntest covering this malformed request-target.\n\nAuthor: Urval Kheni <kheniurval777@gmail.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Urval Kheni",
      "author_email": "kheniurval777@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-06-30T02:06:35.000+05:30",
      "committer_name": "Urval Kheni",
      "committer_email": "kheniurval777@gmail.com",
